AskData's app/token_counting.py reuses the upstream PAT_STR and BPE file format,
with local changes: NFC ordinary-text encoding (no special-token shortcuts),
25 percent estimation margin, message overhead, fixed asset hash verification,
and an explicitly labelled UTF-8-byte fallback. This is not an assertion of
exact tokenization or billing for the closed qwen3.7 models.
